{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「維港泳2026」今早（15日）舉行，近4,000名泳手由灣仔金紫荊廣場公眾碼頭出發，游至位於尖沙咀星光大道的終點，全程約1公里。早上6時多，通往起點的博覽道東沿途已有不少人更衣，氣氛熱烈。其中，有第二度出戰的參與者今次與兒子組「父子檔」。被問及會不會與兒子鬥快，他則笑指「唔會，想一齊衝線」。</p><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557668860891136582601.jpeg/li9maneloabZOJR_4vVeJ7g3DNloF5uqFxvbcjIb23I\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557668659433472385601.jpeg/mxpz3Dm1y8Bu5WcdZck-5LnmAnanbVuBX7sSFnq7EhY\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557666004307968649205.jpeg/LKFd8KLg_OO-6lEg7_hfKLhHirhe5UM5R6Sea2Kknms\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄭小姐（左）表示，完賽後會與其他朋友一起在香港逛逛、吃東西。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557667824766976718634.jpeg/BQVnTmNPlCMfOS4W4wGBYLcxgUVHptxapvwLI4P8CyM\"/><figcaption>鄭小姐（左）表示，完賽後會與其他朋友一起在香港逛逛、吃東西。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><p>深圳選手四時起床到場</p><p>今屆賽事設有兩個項目，由競賽組打頭陣，於早上7時半出發，約300名選手爭奪獎項。緊接其後的優悠組分為4組出發，共約3,700人參加。起點設於灣仔金紫荊廣場公眾碼頭，通往金紫荊廣場的博覽道東沿途已有不少人在更衣。</p><p>居於深圳的鄭小姐今早4時多已起床前來，她表示不擔心太早起床會體力不繼，因為平時也有練習，不過從未在香港公開水域游泳。她之前也來過維港旅遊，但從未下過水，所以也很期待能夠參與這項歷史悠久的賽事。她亦表示，完賽後會與其他朋友一起在香港逛逛、吃東西。</p><figure><img alt=\"為了備戰，盧小姐特別在兩天前參加了一個在沙頭角的賽事，感受一下香港的公開水域。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557673588002816135498.jpeg/lG_MKMG4gFrYOh0qsduZi6sudlvtmYPyw8B7nObAe5w\"/><figcaption>為了備戰，盧小姐特別在兩天前參加了一個在沙頭角的賽事，感受一下香港的公開水域。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃先生首次與兒子一同參賽，稱希望一齊衝線。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557675525771264925318.jpeg/cGWw6huqwzk5vUZ6NBOYr3NaEXLTewbiu8CnZ57Ap2c\"/><figcaption>黃先生首次與兒子一同參賽，稱希望一齊衝線。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557663361896448175960.jpeg/mrRWqTY2lxY29Ci_FVw8Lxck1Zi6A3AUbxXPS0oVz0s\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557668642787328862475.jpeg/rIlADu8n8sMPmzIXtETuSrsHCAtVfbMU1AbEH_EGxB8\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557671838846976849075.jpeg/LO8LzW5jcqDewkSY9UaWzYJ4hdnt2FQ9J0QihAJEIoQ\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557668084813824156238.jpeg/U71bVo7RLtKQ1SFIEWsaJtNI7kWrfNVek_bzerb283o\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557665102532608093815.jpeg/Lkh2yrHO2mWjFspVA98XE8nxwT5zGNboYcbP2UTGz9k\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557661340110848367802.jpeg/26aGCzq-OlIOztMBUfACQY_HDrKbtgkj3HyVD_l8lQ8\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557670932877312034289.jpeg/FZ0P3TG7imDzDPsS0zQMQTBwZnfPaGJRU7GAAnaxgAI\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557664565661696529163.jpeg/R2tdIJHgiV1VSj37-TfFKMQzNNXE09Jid8dZQFLHWUA\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557661407219712705693.jpeg/jvepj5GUelFDJYJhOb8O-dNrj68-6RXn26mWiv6ploo\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557675177644032897213.jpeg/RrCnNVhUoAxGZiz9elWOY_d6Upu217VpVRNRjXATUY0\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557671977259008730819.jpeg/YLjuxNn-TN5swg3YMWdqIkYJAFUgkIos4p-tq8efras\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557668864954368189736.jpeg/QPsZnHOC1xOGTwoseaxiHiJFDaRLA7DbaDbChE02woQ\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557665656180736976538.jpeg/ZcR99nUrLR7oiw2I1XHyODGfL1GWptoug77f2Ka-39g\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557662187360256293781.jpeg/C76JOpb8o7wuEDg9i5L2Te91fCt8EUSKFd5e3TDeXt0\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557672388300800210675.jpeg/SqgqAxZ5biKwUfswlDWBFBbFVtKViztIvTXAYZg1wGE\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557665790398464493871.jpeg/Z9PfppEU1cX0hNBH8acaNJNjc4TAwFRcyawyveysMr0\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557662397075456362570.jpeg/EZQs7Py7ZUQg_wpWe-V_hnOwy1M6vgLgp8ghK4LIISs\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557675823566848801543.jpeg/HX4_BE3nQMxpn8i22_d9Bj13JihGgJOI8Z1EpdSdRKU\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557672467992576395817.jpeg/xD9JBzyVPujldxdU-eaJ51DWcfH4wyCL_BfGm9kXxps\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557669104029696721458.jpeg/qxykrBJzBy12X0ecjNl6EKHdM7xlASWFzETh1ulE4dY\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557662812311552039526.jpeg/3SyMAo4t1x7jEpwZ_WbHqMSfGgaljIl_vyFj2pohY9o\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557671268552704065794.jpeg/pV3HopKu3hxy6Dvh9b4v322Nwuqq1bJI3SdPmPgnT5g\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557665895387136451897.jpeg/mskjQBe1ysh3h8HpDuz1VovMJ8BhyKJkKeMSkAzjEpA\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557662707585024351286.jpeg/DNA61WtsnJkyBArf7TS4KfJ7NJ0myuswI0Y6BgZGOgY\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557659192627200735689.jpeg/wxVYRN1np3elohAzuj528rY2I_45VHQl_X073th9O94\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557671310495744082631.jpeg/m7Op2lu2zx-7-qB0t1PWnqm4ho6uDR8Qm8TPEr7EzxI\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557668860891136582601.jpeg/li9maneloabZOJR_4vVeJ7g3DNloF5uqFxvbcjIb23I\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557666067353600701952.jpeg/H9mXVPolA6tNtHE9tX5I3Papvc8KrMVyQa1O7mStTu4\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557663361896448175960.jpeg/mrRWqTY2lxY29Ci_FVw8Lxck1Zi6A3AUbxXPS0oVz0s\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557659461062656341962.jpeg/MLSmL33KhHLHC5BPXYYiAbGwNxjgOtHaasnp9E_J6fQ\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557765913022464930418.jpeg/ITC-d-BLD_zPV-WYWKiQEjtkuMeg1hhZvONQr5njUK8\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557762066714624759648.jpeg/-xFqB0LzBHE5vip2ccvP5CZkBXcDdqVgSL3gjW294I0\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557758123937792178654.jpeg/Zs16ZDGEinByXGmB0CwAK1CuCjpRqiyynyC867ogvOs\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557754332155904689075.jpeg/-0xA6ayQP13nGZhDdCvhWMu3_skv5YN880dMutZHTLo\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198557750557151232970143.jpeg/Iu5WeIn0gtIPDuY76_kwu7FZuVQZl1B5714pTspeKU4\"/><figcaption>維港泳2026今日舉行。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><p>深圳泳手早來港備戰</p><p>同樣來自深圳的盧小姐則表示，維港泳的氣氛很好，所以與朋友一同參加。為了備戰，她特別在兩天前參加了一個在沙頭角的賽事，感受一下香港的公開水域。她指當時感覺不錯，覺得今日應該也可以順利完成。</p><p>現場亦有不少本地人。黃先生今次是第四次報名比賽，但因為疫情等原因，只是第二次最終有「落場」。今日早上氣溫約21度，他認為很舒服，也不會太大風。他表示上次體驗不錯，維港水質也頗佳。而與上次不同的是，今次兒子也一同參加。被問及會不會與兒子鬥快，他則笑指「唔會，想一齊衝線」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:13:19.234660+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1460,"images":41,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:54:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T04:29:06.752473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:06:33.205110+00:00","content_hash":"95df33c882cc11b58fe8c373a02ddeb2525f191f4f0d8a1332087ab0dc846f07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}